### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Generate routine (hardcoded detected equipment, Phase 1 stub exercises)
POST http://localhost:4000/generate-routine
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "detectedEquipment": [
    { "id": "dumbbell", "label": "Dumbbells", "confidence": 0.95, "sourcePhotoIndex": 0, "userConfirmed": true },
    { "id": "bench", "label": "Bench", "confidence": 0.9, "sourcePhotoIndex": 0, "userConfirmed": true }
  ],
  "goal": "biceps",
  "intensity": "light"
}

### Voice characters list
GET http://localhost:4000/voice-characters

### TTS (requires GOOGLE_TTS_API_KEY / ELEVENLABS_API_KEY set in server/.env)
POST http://localhost:4000/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "characterId": "hype_coach",
  "scriptKey": "start"
}
